\par\par \b \uc2 EMERGING MARKETS- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's real falls after  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 432 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Mai 2016\par 23:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (Adds final prices)\par     BRASILIA, May 2 (Reuters) - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Brazil\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's real weakened almost\par 1.5 percent on Monday, hurt by a drop in global commodities\par prices and heavy \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  aimed at curbing\par gains in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which recently hit eight-month highs.\par     Other Latin American \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  and stock markets saw light\par trade as holidays in Europe and Asia helped reduce volumes.\par Commodities prices fell more than 1 percent as Brent\par crude fell about 3 percent.\par     The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Brazilian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  offered $2 billion in reverse\par swaps, the second day of government \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . The real\par  weakened 1.45 percent to 3.4900 to the U.S. dollar.\par     Brazil's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has strengthened partly due to hopes of a\par more investor-friendly government in Brasilia ahead of the\par expected suspension of leftist President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dilma Rousseff\f28 \uc2 \f2  during\par an impeachment trial.\par     Economists, however, warn a stronger \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may hurt\par exports and delay Brazil's recovery from its worst recession in\par decades.\par     "Favorable domestic drivers would have had a significantly\par larger impact on the real were it not for heavy \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ," \f28 \uc2 \f2 Goldman Sachs\f28 \uc2 \f2 ' Alberto Ramos and Tiago Severo\par wrote in a research report.\par     In equities markets, bank shares led the Brazilian Bovespa\par stock index slightly lower, a reaction to rig builder\par Sete Brasil Participa\u231\'00\'E7\u245\'00\'F5es SA's move to file for protection from\par creditors on Friday.\par     \f28 \uc2 \f2 Ita\u250\'00\'FA Unibanco Holding SA\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \f28 \uc2 \f2 Banco Bradesco SA\f28 \uc2 \f2 \par , \f28 \uc2 \f2 Banco Santander Brasil SA\f28 \uc2 \f2  and\par state-controlled Caixa Econ\u244\'00\'F4mica Federal and Banco do\par Brasil SA all had Sete Brasil as a client.\par  \par     \par     Key Latin American stock indexes and \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at 2100 GMT:\par     \par  Stock                         Latest    daily %   YTD % change\par    indexes                               change    \par  \f28 \uc2 \f2 MSCI\f28 \uc2 \f2  Emerging Markets         835.57    -0.55     5.22\par                                                    \par  MSCI LatAm                    2257.90   -1.49     23.4\par                                                    \par  Brazil Bovespa                53561.53  -0.65     23.56\par  Mexico IPC                    45707.87  -0.17     6.35\par  Chile IPSA                    4004.04   0.05      8.80\par  Chile IGPA                    19679.84  0.13      8.42\par  Argentina MerVal              13549.01  -1.27     16.05\par  Colombia IGBC                 9934.81   -0.27     16.23\par  Venezuela IBC                 15617.70  -0.34     7.06\par                                                    \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2                     Latest    daily %   YTD % change\par                                          change    \p