\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil central bank \highlight\uc2  to scale back  \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 272 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2016\par 19:17\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2016 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds swap contract details, background)\par \par \uc2 BRASILIA, March 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Thursday it would scale back \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  following the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rally to near its strongest levels in more than half a year.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Brazil\uc2  said in a statement it would reduce the intensity of its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap auctions due to a window of opportunity offered by the current international economic outlook. It did not offer details on the scale of the shift.\par \par \uc2 The Brazilian real has rallied this month after the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  scaled back expectations of interest rate hikes and traders bet on higher odds of Brazil's Congress impeaching President \uc2 Dilma Rousseff\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The real gained more than 2 percent on Thursday, to trade at 3.64 per dollar, outperforming other Latin American \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A Reuters poll on Thursday showed 11 out of 17 economists believed \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should start to reduce its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by rolling over 30 percent to 97 percent of its outstanding swap contracts.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has about $110 billion in outstanding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps on its books, contracts which offer protection from sharp \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  devaluations and were in high demand last year as the exchange rate hit record lows near 4.25 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts have criticized the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's high-cost \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy. The bank had been fully rolling over the stock of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps for several months. (Reporting by Alonso Soto; Writing by Silvio Cascione; Editing by Daniel Flynn and Richard Chang) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-3-17T19:17:54.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160317ec3h01sic\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
