\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Real Recovers Some Ground After  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Announces  \highlight22\uc2 Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 September 2015\par 18:26\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    By Jeffrey T. Lewis and Luciana Magalhaes \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 SAO PAULO--The Brazilian real recovered some lost ground on Wednesday after the country's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  announced \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 interventions\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to prop up the tumbling \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 The bank announced auctions of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts and dollar repurchase agreements on Wednesday after a volatile day of trading. The real went from 4.0150 to the dollar in morning trading to 4.1430 in the early afternoon, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet. The real was trading at 4.1099 to the dollar at 1:05 p.m., after closing at 4.0450 on Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 The bank has already used auctions of both the instruments to help support the real. In 2013 the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started a program of regular auctions of dollar swap agreements, which help businesses hedge against Brazil's weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The bank stopped auctioning off new swap agreements earlier this year, but has been rolling over existing contracts. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has held auctions of the dollar repurchase agreements, which temporarily inject the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in to the market, on three previous occasions in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 The head of the bank's exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Alan Mendes, said before Wednesday's auctions were announced that the bank isn't seeing an outflow of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from Brazil.\par \par \uc2 The real has slumped in recent days, going from 3.9480 against the dollar at the close last Friday, to Wednesday's record lows against the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The real was launched in 1994, replacing the previous \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of a plan to tame the country's out-of-control inflation.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeffrey T. Lewis at jeffrey.lewis@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 September 23, 2015 12:26 ET (16:26 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150923eb9n0025y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
