 ability to save and reduce debt, and the proposal was an indication that the government's efforts to rein in spending and cut debt could be faltering.\par \par \uc2 Write to Jeffrey T. Lewis at \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJTNAF1120150910eb9a00017\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
