\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  to Increase  \highlight22\uc2 Foreign-Exchange Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rogerio Jelmayer   \par \uc2 219 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 2015\par 13:04\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 S\u195\'00\'C3O PAULO--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will step up its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, as the real continues to weaken sharply against the dollar amid economic and political uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would increase the pace of rollovers of dollar swaps on Friday, offering to roll over up to 11,000 swap contracts at auction, compared with 6,000 contacts offered in previous sessions.\par \par \uc2 That means the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will offer to roll over up to $550 million in swap contracts, compared with $300 million previously.\par \par \uc2 The swap auction is the equivalent of the sale of dollars in the futures markets. The real has weakened sharply in recent weeks as Latin America's largest nation faces a combination of poor economic performance and political turmoil, putting at risk the government's plan to cut spending and reduce its debt.\par \par \uc2 Brazil's real closed Thursday at 3.5399 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, after closing at 3.4877 on Wednesday. The last time the real traded weaker than 3.50 to the dollar was in 2003.\par \par \uc2 Write to Rogerio Jelmayer at rogerio.jelmayer@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 August 07, 2015 07:04 ET (11:04 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150807eb87001b4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
