\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  to Reduce  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 274 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Juni 2015\par 15:05\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 S\u195\'00\'C3 O PAULO\u8212\'20\'14The \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced one more step to reduce its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, as the Brazilian real shows signs of stabilization in recent days.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  Wednesday night said it would reduce the volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap contracts offered through daily auctions to $315 million, from $350 million previously.\par \par \uc2 The real immediately weakened against the dollar Thursday after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move. The real was trading at 3.1543 to the dollar at 12:34 p.m. GMT, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, after closing at 3.1158 on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 In April 2013, the bank began the auctions in an effort to prop up the real against the dollar. The contracts give businesses a way to hedge against a weaker real without forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell its reserves.\par \par \uc2 Then, in the first quarter of this year, the bank stopped offering new contracts and just offered certain swap contracts to ensure liquidity in the market.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not wait until the end of the month to reduce the pace of rollovers, which indirectly tells us that the authorities did not see with good eyes the recent BRL/USD strengthening," said Alberto Ramos, an economist at \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The real sharply depreciated versus the dollar in the first months of this year, but in recent sessions it had flattened, in the area of 3.10 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 Jeffrey T. Lewis contributed to this article.\par \par \uc2 Write to Rogerio Jelmayer at rogerio.jelmayer@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 June 11, 2015 09:05 ET (13:05 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020150611eb6b001ni\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
