\par\par \b \uc2 With Eye On Friday GDP Stat,  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2  Ends Daily  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Intervention \highlight\uc2  -- Barron's Blog\b0\par\par\uc2 By Dimitra DeFotis   \par \uc2 603 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2015\par 20:56\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 The willingness of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to allow the real to float without increased \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  represents a shift in economic policy taking place that is necessary and positive, according to Nomura analysts.\par \par \uc2 However, \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's future \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  decisions depend on the performance of \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's real, especially as the U.S. Federal reserve "comes closer to lift-off in its monetary tightening, say analysts \uc2 Joao Pedro Ribeiro\uc2  and Benito Berber at Nomura. They write:\par \par \uc2 "The \uc2 Brazilian \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced, on Tuesday, March 24, alterations to its \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program and confirmed the changes the market had been anticipating ... The daily offer of new swaps contracts will end at the end of March and the BCB will keep its current stock of outstanding swaps unchanged by rolling over expiring contracts ... This newfound inclination is in line with the overall shift in economic policy taking place in Brazil since President \uc2 Dilma Rousseff\uc2 's reelection last year, in which long-held imbalances are being adjusted to better reflect economic realities. We see these adjustments as necessary and positive for the economy.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  pointed out that the non-financial sector of the economy seems to be appropriately hedged against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakening. An important market concern is the issuance of dollar debt, particularly that of Brazilian subsidiaries outside of Brazil. Given the significant USD long position of the non-financial corporate sector -- nearly two-thirds of liabilities maturing in the next year, by our estimates -- we do not see this exposure as a major concern ..."\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 iShares MSCI Brazil Capped ETF\uc2  ( EWZ) is down 1.1% today. Shares of \uc2 Petroleo Brasileiro\uc2  ( PBR), the state-controlled energy company under investigation for alleged corruption, are the biggest mover, up 3.5%. \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  announced Wednesday that the executive board Tuesday approved a review by the CEO and board of \uc2 Petrobras\uc2 ' "corporate governance and organizational management model based on new business environment and the review of the company's investment plan."\par \par \uc2 Shares of \uc2 Itau Unibanco Holding\uc2  ( ITUB) have fallen 1.2% today.\par \par \uc2 Brazil got a reprieve Monday when \uc2 Standard & Poor's\uc2  rating agency maintained the country's investment-grade credit rating. But on Friday, more negative economic growth statistics could send Brazil's market lower. The Wall Street Journal noted in the rating story that:\par \par \uc2 "Brazil's statistics agency will release on Friday its report for gross domestic product in 2014, and economists expect it to show a contraction. GDP will also shrink in 2015, by about 1%, according to a weekly survey of economists carried out by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 See the Wall Street Journal story, " After S&P Ratings Reprieve, Brazil Faces Some Tough Economic News." \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  More at Barron's Emerging Markets blog, \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://blogs.barrons.com/emergingmarketsdaily/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://blogs.barrons.com/emergingmarketsdaily/}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petr\u243\'00\'F3leo Brasileiro SA\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=BRPETRACNOR9"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=BRPETRACNOR9}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petr\u243\'00\'F3leo Brasileiro SA\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=BRPETRACNPR6"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=BRPETRACNPR6}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Nomura Holdings, Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=JP3762600009"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=JP3762600009}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 iShares MSCI Brazil Capped ETF\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US4642864007"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US4642864007}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Nomura Holdings, Inc\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US65535H2085"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US65535H2085}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 Access Investor Kit for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Petr\u243\'00\'F3leo Brasileiro SA\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Visit \f28 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US71654V4086"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.companyspotlight.com/partner?cp_code=P479&isin=US71654V4086}}