\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  will not extend  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2  program\b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2015\par 01:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details on \b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and economic problems)               \par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO, March 24 (Reuters) - \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  announced on Tuesday it will not extend its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program past March 31 as a combination of political problems at home and fears of higher U.S. interest rates push the real near its lowest levels in a decade.               \par \par \uc2 The bank will, however, roll over all swaps expiring after May 1.               \par \par \uc2 The real has been one of the worst performing \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  this month losing 10 percent against the dollar.               \par \par \uc2 While all emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  have suffered from fears of higher U.S. interest rates, a number of domestic problems have further weighed on the real.               \par \par \uc2 Among those issues are Brazil's current account deficit and a massive corruption scandal at state-run oil company \uc2 Petrobras\uc2  , as well as uncertainty about the approval of austerity measures proposed by President \uc2 Dilma Rousseff\uc2 , whose political coalition is increasingly fragmented.               \par \par \uc2 Uncertainty about the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strategy to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market had also added to the long list of problems weighing on the real.               \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also said it will sell dollars with repurchase agreements if it needs to boost liquidity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.               \par \par \uc2 The bank said if deemed necessary it may also use "additional \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  instruments at its disposal" to stabilize the exchange rate.               \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  program has provided investors with a daily supply of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, derivatives that offer protection against \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses, since August 2013.               \par \par \uc2 The bank has recently been offering $100 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps in daily auctions Mondays through Fridays.               \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-3-25T01:08:54.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150325eb3p0008i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
