\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Brazil central bank \highlight\uc2  halves  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\uc2  program in 2015\b0\par\par\uc2 455 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Dezember 2014\par 22:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2014 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds details about \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank FX intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, background)\par \par \uc2 By Walter Brandimarte\par \par \uc2 RIO DE JANEIRO, Dec 30 (Reuters) - \uc2 Brazil's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday announced it will continue to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at least until the end of March, although it will cut by half the supply of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedge it offers on a daily basis to support the real.\par \par \uc2 The bank said in a statement it will sell as much as $100 million worth of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps in daily auctions from Mondays through Fridays, down from the $200 million it currently offers to investors seeking protection against possible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  losses.\par \par \uc2 The bank's decision comes as emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are being battered by a plunge in oil and commodities prices, concerns about China's economic slowdown, and prospects for higher interest rates in the United States.\par \par \uc2 In Brazil, the real has lost more than 10 percent in 2014, fueling an already high inflation rate and forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to further raise interest rates.\par \par \uc2 Some economists estimate the real should be trading weaker than 3 per dollar were it not for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It closed the year at 2.6575 per dollar.\par \par \uc2 An overvalued \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  fight inflation but has also created economic distortions, leaving local industry at a competitive disadvantage versus international peers and adding to Brazil's trade and current account deficits.\par \par \uc2 Brazilian policymakers introduced regular auctions of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps in August 2013 in a bid to stabilize Brazil's volatile exchange rate. But rather than just curbing \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  volatility, the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program became a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  tool to fight inflation, economists say.\par \par \uc2 Since the program started, the bank has accumulated a stock of over $100 billion in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps, derivatives that mimic the sale of dollars in the futures market.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chief Alexandre Tombini has said that stock of swaps is already enough to meet businesses' demand for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hedge, but that the bank was "not in a rush" to unwind the program.\par \par \uc2 Right after announcing the extension of its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  program, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will offer on Friday up to 10,000 \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps to roll over contracts that expire early in February.\par \par \uc2 In addition to selling \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps daily, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will sell dollars with repurchase agreements if it needs to boost liquidity in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, according to the statement posted on the bank's website.\par \par \uc2 The bank also said it may sell dollars using "all instruments within its reach" to stabilize the exchange rate. (Reporting by Walter Brandimarte; Editing by Diane Craft and Meredith Mazzilli)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-1-2T21:11:20.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020141230eacu00jzh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
