\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Brazil \highlight\uc2 's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Steps Up  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Rogerio Jelmayer   \par \uc2 234 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 2014\par 11:42\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2014, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SAO PAULO--\b \highlight22\uc2 Brazil\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday said it will step up its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues to weaken sharply versus the dollar because of political uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it will increase the pace of rollovers of dollar swaps on Monday, offering to roll over up to 14,000 swap contracts at auction, compared with 9,000 contacts offered in previous sessions.\par \par \uc2 That means the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will offer to roll over up to $700 million in swap contracts, compared with $450 million previously.\par \par \uc2 The swap auction is the equivalent of the sale of dollars in the futures markets.\par \par \uc2 The real has weakened sharply since President \uc2 Dilma Rousseff\uc2  won reelection in late October, on concerns about the direction of economic policy.\par \par \uc2 Added to that is a growing corruption scandal at the country's giant oil company, \uc2 Petroleo Brasileiro SA\uc2 , or \uc2 Petrobras\uc2 . On Friday, the firm delayed its third-quarter results due to the deepening problems.\par \par \uc2 Last week, the real approached nine-year lows versus the dollar. The real ended Friday at BRL2.5981 to the dollar, according to Tullett Prebon via FactSet, compared with BRL2.5950 at Thursday's close.\